<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SICC Sovereign Registry - Reglas de Juego</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0a192f;
            --primary-light: #112240;
            --accent: #ffd700;
            --accent-soft: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
            --steel: #8892b0;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --danger: #ff4d4d;
            --success: #64ffda;
        }

        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }

        body {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, #112240 0%, #0a192f 100%);
            color: #e6f1ff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Lateral Identity */
        .identity-bar {
            width: 80px;
            background: rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.9);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            position: fixed;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .identity-logo { font-size: 1.5rem; filter: saturate(0); opacity: 0.5; margin-bottom: 3rem; }

        /* Main Dashboard */
        .content {
            margin-left: 80px;
            flex: 1;
            padding: 5rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
        }

        .header { margin-bottom: 6rem; position: relative; }
        .header::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -2rem; left: 0;
            width: 100px; height: 4px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .header h4 {
            color: var(--accent);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--steel);
            max-width: 800px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Matrix of Rules */
        .rules-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(400px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .rule-card {
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 3.5rem;
            transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .rule-card:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            transform: translateY(-15px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .rule-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0;
            width: 150px; height: 150px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 70%);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: 0.5s;
        }

        .rule-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

        .rule-tag {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
            background: var(--accent-soft);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            align-self: flex-start;
        }

        .rule-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; }
        .rule-summary { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--steel); line-height: 1.6; }

        .rule-impact {
            margin-top: auto;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding-top: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .impact-value { color: var(--success); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; }
        .impact-label { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--steel); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }

        .btn-view {
            width: 50px; height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: 0.3s;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .rule-card:hover .btn-view {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: var(--primary);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            transform: rotate(-45deg);
        }

        .stats-footer {
            margin-top: 8rem;
            padding-top: 4rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex;
            gap: 5rem;
        }

        .stat-item h3 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent); }
        .stat-item p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--steel); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content { padding: 2rem; }
            .header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .rules-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="identity-bar">
        <div class="identity-logo">⚖️</div>
    </div>

    <main class="content">
        <header class="header">
            <h4>Legal Blindage Architecture</h4>
            <h1>Reglas de Juego</h1>
            <p>Repositorio inmutable de dictámenes técnico-contractuales que definen el polígono de ingeniería para el proyecto LFC. Soberanía jurídica aplicada al diseno.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="rules-grid">
            <!-- MASTER RECIPE: SUP TRACK LOGIC -->
            <a href="DT-SICC-V8-SUP-TRK_Optimizacion_Geometria_Via.html" class="rule-card" style="border-color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05);">
                <div class="rule-tag" style="background: #fbbf24; color: #0a192f;">SUENO SUSTRACTIVO v8.3</div>
                <div class="rule-title">Track Logic: Optimización de Geometría</div>
                <div class="rule-summary">Consolidación de los 5 nodos ENCE para suprimir desvíos manuales redundantes. Aplica la obligación de resultado contractual para reducir la partida 1.5.100 en un 25%.</div>
                
                <div class="rule-impact">
                    <div>
                        <div class="impact-label">CAPEX Protegido</div>
                        <div class="impact-value">917,000 USD</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="btn-view">→</div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- MASTER RECIPE: SUP EOT -->
            <a href="DT-SICC-V8-SUP-EOT_Supresion_Integridad_Redundante.html" class="rule-card" style="border-color: #ef4444; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);">
                <div class="rule-tag" style="background: #ef4444; color: #fff;">SUENO SUSTRACTIVO v8.2</div>
                <div class="rule-title">EOT: Supresión de Hardware de Integridad</div>
                <div class="rule-summary">Validación de la integridad del tren vía software (OBC/GPS). Suprime 15 dispositivos físicos EOT, eliminando el CAPEX de hardware y el OPEX de mantenimiento de baterías en cola.</div>
                
                <div class="rule-impact">
                    <div>
                        <div class="impact-label">CAPEX Protegido</div>
